column3:
The league day: the fixture list news on its day, each stage's day, the +0xc9 date event, the season end (next stage, history, records), the TV fixtures four weeks ahead, the registration deadline 5/20/14 days before the first date and the +0xd1 date. 
 Ret 8; SEH frame with no destructor on the normal path (the local dates): `League::update_for_date(date, full)`, the day of each league (through the competitions, 46522 calls up to 2002-06-01). League stopped (+0xb5) or without clubs (+0x45 = 0): 0. Otherwise (returns 1, in the byte): 
 - +0xa7 = -1 with teams (+0x3e) > 0: +0xa7 = (teams − 1) · legs (+0x3c), in the word; 
 - in the first stage (+0x44 = 0xff) with a table (+0xb1, +0x11 = 0), full and a new date (≠ +0xd1): on the day after the key nation's Cup day (0x669470; `[0xb63d75 + 72·k]` + 1, 0 after 364) and in the league year (+0x40), the table news (0x683ee0: push 0; mov ecx, this -> thiscall, ret 4); 
 - in the first stage, each stage's day (+0xc, up to +0x30; method 0x14 with the date and the full flag); 
 - on date +0xc9 (without +0xdd): +0xad = 0 and method 0x94; 
 - in the first stage with a table and a new date: method 0x10 (0, 0); season end (+0xdd = 1) with all stages finished (method 0x10 with (0, 1) ≠ 0): the next stage (method 0x28) if +0x30 < +0x2c − 1, otherwise (once, +0x4c) the history (0x442e80: push league; mov ecx, `[0xad9da8]` -> thiscall, ret 4), the records with 1 (0x447430: push 1; push league; mov ecx, `[0xad9dac]` -> thiscall, ret 8) if the competition counts (0x4b0700: push id; add esp, 4 -> cdecl), the box at line 0x74c if +0xe6, method 0x30 and the end of attachment +8 (0x4a19f0: mov ecx, `[+8]` -> thiscall, ret 0); then the records with 0 and the attachment (0x4a2450: mov ecx, `[+8]` -> thiscall, ret 0); 
 - with a table and full, without +0xdd: the TV fixtures four weeks ahead (0x54c770 + 0x685640: push &date; mov ecx, this -> thiscall, ret 4); 
 - full: in the first stage with registrations (+0x52 bit 2), a new date, without +0xdd and the table in progress: if the first date of the TV table (+0xba; day, year − the league's) falls 5 days from now (Argentina `[0x9cf218]`), 20 (Italy `[0x9cf360]`) or 14 days, the registration deadline (0x859e20: push 0; push 0; push league; mov ecx, `[0xdd7ef0]` -> thiscall, ret 0xc); and +0xd1 takes the date (0x417c10).
